<title>POLAND: Novita revises down 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Novita revises down 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novita preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     7.11   vs    4.25</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 6.00   vs    2.71</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.39   vs    1.90</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is Novita SA, which previously showed a 1996 net profit of 3.80 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			     67.59   vs   55.11</p>
<p>    costs of sales			50.22   vs   42.08</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.05   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.61   vs    0.82</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   4.25   vs    3.79</p>
<p>    financial costs			5.31   vs    5.30</p>
<p>    investment			     7.23   vs    7.96</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
